commit cc7821b25d96ab62a5126eba301b81fcc34a92e8
Author: Minxi Hou <houminxi@gmail.com>
Date:   Sun Jul 26 11:42:56 2026 -0400

    pipeline: Book B shadow ledger + timing multiplier seam
    
    Add control book infrastructure for L2 timing gate (G3):
    
    - timing_multiplier(trade_date, model) returns 1.0 for model='none';
      seam for future null models (N1=MA trend, N2=vol percentile,
      N3=drawdown state map) without refactoring.
    - _step12_book_b(ctx) runs Book B shadow ledger after Book A settle.
      Shares ctx.prices/prediction/universe (no re-fetch). Owns
      paper_b_{book_id}.db for positions/cash/orders/nav. Fail-open
      try/except wrapping.
    - m scales target_value at order generation (cash allocation).
      m=1.0 reproduces Book A to the cent (R3).
    - _bootstrap_book_b copies production DB on Day 0.
    - _write_abc_artifact writes daily A/B/C comparison JSON at
      experiments/control_books/.
    
    Tests: 11 new (timing_multiplier, bootstrap, fail-open, artifact,
    known-answer validation).
    
    Signed-off-by: Minxi Hou <houminxi@gmail.com>

